{"unit_id":"IKEASven69__dsh-takeover#feature-1","repo":"IKEASven69/dsh-takeover","commit":"19a2f597118a8387e64ab4d3e2d444167deb14cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-takeover 的功能「读取外部会话」：列出九种本地 agent 的会话候选，并按引用生成结构化摘要和交接素材。通过 foreign_session_read 工具调用，可按需分页查看原始轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/foreign.ts:615-622"]}
{"unit_id":"IKEASven69__dsh-takeover#feature-2","repo":"IKEASven69/dsh-takeover","commit":"19a2f597118a8387e64ab4d3e2d444167deb14cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-takeover 的功能「寄存会话进度」：把当前 DSH 会话的目标、文件、进展和后续工作等整理为 handoff: 1 卡片，写入共享收件箱；未提供的段落可从会话事件生成。调用 handoff_push 或使用 /handoff。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:902-914","skills/handoff.ts:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"IKEASven69__dsh-takeover#feature-3","repo":"IKEASven69/dsh-takeover","commit":"19a2f597118a8387e64ab4d3e2d444167deb14cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-takeover 的功能「领取交接卡」：先列出待处理卡片，再按卡片 id 载入一张并归档，供当前会话继续工作。可调用 handoff_inbox 的 list、load 操作，或使用 /inbox。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:953-960","skills/inbox.ts:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"IKEASven69__dsh-takeover#feature-4","repo":"IKEASven69/dsh-takeover","commit":"19a2f597118a8387e64ab4d3e2d444167deb14cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-takeover 的功能「交接 agent 记忆」：扫描常见的用户级或项目级记忆文件，显示来源清单，并可选择文件内容打包成收件箱卡片。通过 handoff_memory 工具的 scan、push 操作使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/memory.ts:33-46","src/memory.ts:243-251"]}
